---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Tea & Toast"
  description="Terms and conditions governing the use of Tea & Toast recipe blog."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-6">
      Terms of Service
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-8">
      Last updated: September 2026
    </p>

    <div class="prose prose-stone max-w-none text-stone-700 leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-sm">
      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>Tea & Toast</strong>. By accessing or using our website located at teaandtoastblog.com, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">1. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All original recipes, photography, text, graphics, and interactive software on this site are the intellectual property of Tea & Toast unless otherwise credited. You may print recipes for personal, non-commercial home cooking. You may not scrape, syndicate, or redistribute whole articles without explicit written permission.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">2. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        The content on Tea & Toast is provided for informational, entertainment, and culinary educational purposes only. Cooking and baking involve heat, sharp implements, and potential allergens. We do not assume liability for kitchen accidents or recipe outcomes that vary based on ingredient quality, altitude, or appliance differences.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">3. External Links</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may contain links to third-party web sites or services (such as Instagram or affiliate partners) that are not owned or controlled by Tea & Toast. We assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party websites.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">4. Modifications</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right, at our sole discretion, to modify or replace these Terms at any time. Continued use of our site following changes indicates acceptance of the revised terms.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
